"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"DefaultError.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DefaultError"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of errors your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryFn"},{"type":"text","value":" may throw."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tstate","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TState"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TState"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"DefinedQueryObserverResult.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DefinedQueryObserverResult"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3},{"id":"tstate","text":"TState","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype DefinedCreateQueryResult<TData, TError, TState> = BaseQueryNarrowing<TData, TError> & MapToSignals<OmitKeyof<TState, keyof BaseQueryNarrowing, \"safely\">>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-query-experimental/src/types.ts:177](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/angular-query-experimental/src/types.ts#L177)\n\nThe result of `injectQuery` when `initialData` is set — `data` is never `undefined`. Same shape as\n[DefinedQueryObserverResult](DefinedQueryObserverResult.md) from `@tanstack/query-core`, but value fields are exposed as a\n`Signal` while function fields are called directly, unchanged.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type `data` ends up as after `select` runs.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your `queryFn` may throw.\n\n### TState\n\n`TState` = [`DefinedQueryObserverResult`](DefinedQueryObserverResult.md)\\<`TData`, `TError`\\>\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: DefinedCreateQueryResult\ntitle: DefinedCreateQueryResult\n---\n\n```ts\ntype DefinedCreateQueryResult<TData, TError, TState> = BaseQueryNarrowing<TData, TError> & MapToSignals<OmitKeyof<TState, keyof BaseQueryNarrowing, \"safely\">>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-query-experimental/src/types.ts:177](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/angular-query-experimental/src/types.ts#L177)\n\nThe result of `injectQuery` when `initialData` is set — `data` is never `undefined`. Same shape as\n[DefinedQueryObserverResult](DefinedQueryObserverResult.md) from `@tanstack/query-core`, but value fields are exposed as a\n`Signal` while function fields are called directly, unchanged.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type `data` ends up as after `select` runs.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your `queryFn` may throw.\n\n### TState\n\n`TState` = [`DefinedQueryObserverResult`](DefinedQueryObserverResult.md)\\<`TData`, `TError`\\>\n"}
